> SIMULATED SCENARIO DISCLOSURE: All simulated prototype outputs, 3D spatial water-level animations, and scenario metrics are Simulated Scenarios built on documented operational assumptions for SustainX 2026. Only observed facts and explicitly documented assumptions are presented as actual performance or context, and all sources, assumptions, and AI tools used are cited.
